     - Assumptions: Data is independent and identically distributed.
     - Pros: Robust estimate of model performance.
     - Cons: Computationally expensive.
  
  B) **Time Series Split**: Suitable for time series data.
     - Assumptions: Temporal order matters.
     - Pros: Respects temporal structure.
     - Cons: Less data for training in each fold.
