   - Check if any data includes future information relative to the session timestamps.

2. **ID-based Leakage:**
   - Verify that IDs do not encode targets or predictions.

3. **Aggregate Leakage:**
   - Ensure summary statistics do not encode targets.

4. **Train-test Leakage:**
