### Decision 2: Model Selection
Candidate Methods:
  A) **U-Net**: Convolutional neural network for image segmentation. Assumes spatial locality.
  B) **FCN (Fully Convolutional Network)**: Similar to U-Net but without skip connections. Less complex.
  C) **ResNet**: Deep residual network. More complex but can capture deeper features.

Suitability Analysis:
